## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-tenant governance, per-site isolation, and production risk controls for ML services in AWS.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant-based routing and isolation
- SageMaker Endpoints vs Serverless Inferencing
- Feature Store and Model Registry per tenant
- PrivateLink, data residency, and retention policies
- Canary rollout, drift monitoring, automatic rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo routing for per-tenant inference
function routeRequest(req){
  const tenant = req.headers['x-tenant-id'];
  const variant = tenants[tenant]?.variant ?? 'default';
  // forward to SageMaker endpoint with tenant-specific variant
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you enforce per-tenant data retention and purge policies across S3/Feature Store?
- How would you test canary rollouts and trigger rollback automatically?
